+**IPv6.** `bind` also takes an IPv6 address: `"::1"` (IPv6 loopback), a specific global address, or **`"::"` for every
+interface on both IPv6 and IPv4** (dual stack). To serve both families on a public host, `"bind": "::"` is all you
